  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sean Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:17:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:17:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Sean Gallagher. I'm renting, and the landlord's got a dumpster coming for the porch work. It'd sit out front on the street. How long can it stay there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the street, you need a street permit for it. Typically it's granted for a set number of days, and the length depends on what you request on the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the fee? Is there one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:17:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a fee for the permit. I don't have the exact figure in front of me, so the application page or the counter will give you the current amount. The contractor or landlord usually pulls it, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:17:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll tell him. Sorry, hang on, the clock on my microwave's blinking twelve, so I'm not sure what time it is. Is it past two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a quarter after two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, you're open till four then. I'll pass it along. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:18:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
